+        # call.invite fanout. accept_invite() enforces actor==callee, so sender_id=user_id
+        # is the callee and fanout_event_to_conversation excludes the sender -> only the
+        # caller receives this. The /events/poll call.* flatten lifts
+        # call_id/conversation_id/caller_user_id to the top level for the app parser
+        # (SseEnvelopeParser -> CallSignalingHub -> CallEvent.Accepted).
+        try:
